# time-scale 60
# What the shown percentage does while the cell charges, in normal mode. The ADV gives firmware no
# charger control and no current reading, only the voltage at GPIO10. The voltage climbs as a charging
# cell's does, 3700 to 3850 mV in an hour: 25% to 65% on the firmware's own curve.
battery 3700
wait-text "HOME" 60000
# The estimate starts from the saved level and creeps to the cell's; let it settle.
wait 6000000
press up
wait 500
show
battery 3700 3850 60
wait 600000
press up
wait 500
show
wait 600000
press up
wait 500
show
wait 600000
press up
wait 500
show
wait 600000
press up
wait 500
show
wait 600000
press up
wait 500
show
wait 600000
press up
wait 500
show
